{"name":"StoreGetters.md","path":"typedoc/core/store/state/interfaces/StoreGetters.md","format":"markdown","html":"<article class=\"docs-md\"><p><a href=\"../../../../README.md\"><strong>luiskr.com</strong></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"../../../../README.md\">luiskr.com</a> / <a href=\"../README.md\">core/store/state</a> / StoreGetters</p>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/214965eca24f91b1469ed21eb399bf941ad49ce0/core/store/state.ts#L148\">core/store/state.ts:148</a></p>\n<p>The getter facade — components read state exclusively through these\naccessors so the StoreState layout can evolve without touching every\nconsumer. getLang (lowercase-l variant <code>getlang</code> returns the full LangState\nslice) returns just the locale code — both spellings exist for legacy\ncall-site compatibility.</p>\n<h2 id=\"properties\">Properties</h2>\n<h3 id=\"gettheme\">getTheme</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">getTheme: () =&gt; string\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/214965eca24f91b1469ed21eb399bf941ad49ce0/core/store/state.ts#L149\">core/store/state.ts:149</a></p>\n<h4 id=\"returns\">Returns</h4>\n<p><code>string</code></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"geteffectivetheme\">getEffectiveTheme</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">getEffectiveTheme: () =&gt; string\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/214965eca24f91b1469ed21eb399bf941ad49ce0/core/store/state.ts#L150\">core/store/state.ts:150</a></p>\n<h4 id=\"returns\">Returns</h4>\n<p><code>string</code></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"getpreferencesopen\">getPreferencesOpen</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">getPreferencesOpen: () =&gt; boolean\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/214965eca24f91b1469ed21eb399bf941ad49ce0/core/store/state.ts#L151\">core/store/state.ts:151</a></p>\n<h4 id=\"returns\">Returns</h4>\n<p><code>boolean</code></p>\n<hr>\n<h